%
(TCPC work-config servo tuning: rotary small-motion path)
(No probing. No TCPC/TWP entry. Operator must confirm safe rotary clearance.)

G21 G17 G40 G54 G64 P0.001 G80 G90 G94

o<preview_guard> if [#<_task> EQ 0]
  (DEBUG, TCPC_SERVO_TUNE_ROTARY_SMALL preview only)
  M2
o<preview_guard> endif

o<tcpc_off_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.tcpc_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, TCPC servo tune rotary requires TCPC off)
o<tcpc_off_check> endif
o<twp_off_check> if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.motion_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, TCPC servo tune rotary requires TWP off)
o<twp_off_check> endif

(MSG, Confirm safe clearance for +/-2 deg B and +/-5 deg C relative moves)
M0

G91
F120
G1 B2
G1 B-2
G1 C5
G1 C-5

F480
G1 B2
G1 B-2
G1 C5
G1 C-5

G90
(DEBUG, TCPC_SERVO_TUNE_ROTARY_SMALL complete)
M30
%
